//
// Source: the ENDF/B-VIII.0 neutron-induced (nfy) and spontaneous (sfy) fission
// yield sublibraries, as bundled in data/fission_yields.tsv (the copy in the
// crates.io package nucleide-nuclei 0.16.0, BSD-2-Clause). Both sublibraries
// are unchanged carries of ENDF/B-VII.1, the England et al. ENDF-349
// evaluations, apart from Pu-239. ENDF/B-VIII.0 is a US government work
// (NNDC, Brookhaven National Laboratory).
//
// Independent yields only: the yield of a product per fission, after prompt
// neutron emission and before any beta decay. The yields of one set sum to 2.
// Isomeric parents are skipped and isomeric products are folded into the
// ground state. Yields of 1e-9 or less are dropped.
//
// SETS: (parent z, parent a, spontaneous, incident neutron energy in eV or 0.0,
//        first ROWS index, one past the last ROWS index). For a neutron-induced
// set the parent is the target nucleus.
// ROWS: (product z, product a, yield per fission).

